    "Airlock hides who you are, not what happened. Detection isn't perfect, which is why you can review everything before it's sent. Airlock helps you understand and prepare; it doesn't give legal, medical or financial advice.": {},
    "Airlock hides who you are, not what happened. It finds names, places, contact details and IDs on your device and replaces them before anything is sent. Detection isn't perfect, so you always see exactly what leaves. Airlock helps you understand and prepare; it doesn't give legal, medical or financial advice.": {},
    "Airlock is starting": {},
    "Airlock lets you ask the smartest AI about private things, while the details that identify you stay on your device.": {},
    "Airlock sent nothing for this answer, so no receipt was needed.": {},
    "Airlock still works: it seals with strict rules and asks you to check everything. Turn on Apple Intelligence in Settings for the full experience.": {},
    "Airlock still works: it seals with strict rules and asks you to review everything before anything is sent.": {},
    "Airlock stopped this before it left": {},
